<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96521" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενόω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεινόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>straiten, confine, contract</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτήν</span> (the trachea) <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).949
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γαστέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					31.20
				</span></i>
			; =
			<i>angusto</i>, Dosith.<i><span class="en">
				p.435K.
			</span></i>:—mostly in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς στενώτερον
			ἐστενωμέναι</span> (prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνηγμέναι</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρη τὰς διεξόδους ἐστένωται</span>
			<i>have</i> their outlets <i>narrow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				8.1.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεινούμενον αὐλαῖς . .
			ἄλσος</span>, sc. by comparison, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.656.13
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγνόω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>to be in difficulty</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς στιχουργήμασι</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				324
			</span></i>.</div>
